<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">Malakhi</book>
  <para style="h">Malakhi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malakhi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malakhi</para>
  <para style="mt">Malakhi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuphuon khat. Israel tunga Malachi in a gen Topa’ thu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note kang it hi, Topa in ci hi. Ahi vangin note in, “Kote bang nei ci it ei?” na ci uhi. Jacob’ sanggampa Esau hi lo amah? Topa in ci hi. Hizongle Jacob ka it a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ahi vangin Esau ka muda hi; keima in a muoltung gam teng gamkhing suohsahin ama’ luona teng si-alte tenna senel gam ka suohsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Edom in, “Eite ei kivatmai vangin a kisie teng i lamkia ding uhi,” a ci leh Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Amate in lam thei ding uhi, ahi vangin amate pen gam gilo, Topa lungthah denna minam a kici dongin ka susie veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mit mama utawh tam thupieng na mu ding vua, “Israel gamgi hlen dongah Topa lien hi!” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tate in a pa a patawi vua, nasemte in a pupa a patawi uhi. Kei pa khat ka hi leh hei-ah ei kipatawina om ahei? Kei a pu khat ka hi leh hei-ah ei kizatahna om ahei? Keima’ min a simmaw siempute aw, ci-in note tungah Vanglien Topa in ci hi. Note in, “Na min bang kang ci simmaw uh ahei?” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka maitam tungah a sieng lo an tawh biehna na lui uhi. Tuale note in, “Bang ka ci buasah uh ahei?” na ci uhi. Tua pen Topa’ sabuoi kisimmaw thei hi, ci-a na ngaisutna utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biehpiehna dinga a mittaw ganhingte nang pieh uh ciengin tua khu khielna hi lo amah? A khelbai, a cinate nei pieh ciengun tua khu khielna hi lo amah? Na gam uhpa kungah tuate va puoh ta vawi un; na tung vuah ama lungkimin ang pahta ngel diei mah? Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien in hing lungsietin ang angvan thei nadingin tu-in thum un. Tua khu noma’ khielna ahi hi. Ama in note khatpo tungah a patatna ang lah ding amah? Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka maitam tungah a mawhna-in mei na taw lo nadingun note lahah mi pawlkhat in biehinnpi kotkhahte khah uleh maw! Na tung vuah ka lung a kim sih a, na khut sung panun biehna ka sang sih ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen nisuo-a kipan nitum dongin minamte lahah ka min lienin, muncin tengah ka minin gimnamtui le biehna siengtho kipie ding hi; azieh pen minamte lahah ka min lien hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa’ sabuoi bua zo ta hi, na ci ciengun tua sabuoi a buasah noma na hi vua, tua an zong na simmaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami khu cimtah huoi sam ei,” na ci vua, kei nei napnit san lel uhi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi. Na biehna dingun tatsietna tawh a kila ganhing ahi a, a liem a bai, ahi sihle a cina khatpo ahi zongin nang peipi uhi! Na khut sung panun tuate kang sang ding amah? Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tuuhonte lahah tuu apa khat pieh dingin kamciem napi, Topa tungah kawbaang biehpiehnate a pie mipa in samsiet nga taheh; azieh pen kei Kumpi lien ka hi a, minamte lahah ka min kizatah hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale tu-in siempute aw, tam thupieh pen note ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note in thu ngai loin na lungsim sung vuah ka min than nading na vom sih uleh, na tung vuah samsietna kang tungsah ding a, na thuphate uh ka samsie ding hi; a tahtahin ci leih, note in na lungsim vuah na vom lo ziehun tuate ka samsie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na suonlehlahte uh phawhsie-in na maitang vuah na biehna ganhingte uh’ eh ka the ding a, ka opna panin note kang lamang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Levi tawh ka thuciemna a kip nadingin note tungah tam thupieh kang lah ahi lam thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama tawh ka kiciemna, ama ka pieh pen nuntah nading le nopsah nading thuciem ahi hi; tuami in zatah ding dei a, ama in kei ei giingin ka min a zatah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kam sungah thuhilna man om a, a lei-ah bangma khielna kimu lo hi. Ama pen citahna le thutangin kei tawh kalsuon a, khielna panin mi tampi kiheisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile siempu pa’ kam in theina a kep kul a, Vanglien Topa’ kamtaipa ahi ziehin mite in ama’ kam panin thuhilna a sui ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin lampi panin note na piel ta uhi; na thuhilna utawh mi tampi na kipalpua sah uhi; note in Levi thuciemna na siesah uhi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka lampi zui loin na thuhilna ah mi deidan na hi ziehin mi zosie mai-ah simmawna le maizumna kang thuohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I unpi-in pa khat nei hi lo i mah? Eite pen Pasien khat beh in ei piensah hi lo i mah? Tua ahile bang dinga eite khatlekhat kimuong loin i pu i pate’ thuciemna i buasah uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah a muonhuoi sih a, Israel le Jerusalem ah a kidahhuoi nate kisem zo hi; azieh pen Topa in a it mama a mun siengtho Judah in buasah zo a, a zi-in gamdang pasien khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam banga a gamta mi poma koikoi hitale a theisah pa ahi a, a dawng pa ahi sihle Vanglien Topa kunga biehna lui pa ahi zongin, Jacob’ puonbuh panin kisumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note in tam zong na sem uhi: Ama in note khut sung panin na biehnate uh lungkim tahin hing sang loin, zong hing thudon nawn lo ahi ziehin note in kaana le tauna hlitui tawh Topa’ maitam na khucip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note in, “Bang dinga ei san lo ahei?” ci-in na dong uhi. Azieh pen thuciemna tawh na lah le na kithuopi hi napi, ama tungah na muontah lona pen na senzi le nangma kikalah Topa teci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nu Pasien khat beh’ siem hi lo amah? Tahsa le hla a nipi-in ama-a’ ahi hi. Tuale khat beh a siemna pen Pasien bang dei ahi diei? Pasien’ suonlehlahte a pien nading ahi hi. Tuaci’n noma le noma ki-en unlen, a senzi tungah koima muontah loin omsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Israel Pasien Topa in, keima in zi khulna ka muda hi, a ci a, tuale tatsietna tawh a zi tunga a gamtatna a selcip mite ka muda hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Note in na thugennate utawh na Topa uh na gimsah uhi. Hinanle note in, “Bangci gimsah ka hi uh ahei?” na ci uhi. “ Topa muna-ah gitlona a bawl zosie mi hoi ahi vua, ama in tuate a kipahpi hi,” ahi sihle, “Thutang Pasien hei-ah a om ahei?” cina tawh na gimsah uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En un, ka lampi siel dingin ka mai-ah ka kamtaipa ka sawl ding a, note in na suisui uh Topa a biehinnpi ah thakhatin ang pei ding hi. Note in na hlagul uh thuciemna kamtaipa ang pei ding hi,” Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama ang pei ni ciengin koi in thuoh zo ding a, ama ang kilah ciengin koi in nang zo ding ahei? Azieh pen ama sia siensahna mei le puonsawpte’ savan tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngun haltui-in a siengsahpa bangin ama to ding a, amate in Topa tungah thuman biehnate a pieh masangsie uh ngun le kham bangin ama in Levi’ suonlehlahte siengsahin haltui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah le Jerusalem in a pieh uh biehnate, nidang lai bangin Topa adingin lungkimhuoi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin thukhen dingin note kungah kang pei ding hi; keima in aitawite, angkawmte, a manlopi-a kiciemte, a kiguoi nasemte’ thaman pie loin a gawt mite, meigong le tagate, pemtate a pampaihte, le keima ei giing lote zosie langkhatah teci pangin mallangin thu ka khen ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima Topa ka kikhel sih hi; tua ahi ziehin no Jacob’ tapate aw, na mangthai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh’ hun lai-a ki panin ka thukhamte panin pielin tuate na zui sih uhi. Kei kungah hing kilekia un, tua hile kei zong na kung vuah kang kilekia ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi. Ahi vangin note in, “Bang hing ci kilekia ding ka hi uh ahei?” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi khat in Pasien’ na a guhpieh ding amah? Hizongle note in keima’ na nei guhpieh uhi! Ahi vangin note in, “Bangci dan a kang guhpieh uh ahei? na ci uhi. Na sawm-ah-khatte ule na biehnate vuah nei guhpieh uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note in keima’ na nei guhpieh ziehun na minam buppi-un awsie tawh note ang kisamsie hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka inn sungah an a op thei nadingin sawm-ah-khat a kimin hing peipi unlen, keima ei zelah un, Vanglien Topa in ci hi. Keima in note adingin vantung tawlette hongin thupha a dimletin kang buohsuh ei, kang buosuh sih ei, ei en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in na leitang pieng na ante uh, kauphe in a suhsiet lo nadingin ka hosie ding hi; lolai-a na lenggui uh ga loin a om sih ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin na gam uh kipah thanopna gam ahi tah ziehin minam zosie in note a nuomsa minamin ang ngaisun ding uhi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note in keima langkhatah kam khauh na ham zo ta uhi, Topa in ci hi. Hinanle note in, “Nangma langkhatah bangci ham ka hi uh ahei?” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note in, “Pasien’ na i sep pen a mawhnapi ahi hi. Eite in a thupieh i zuina uh ahi a, Vanglien Topa mai-ah a kapte banga i va kawikawina uh ahi zongin, bang i phattuompi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in eite in a kiphasahte mi nuomsa i ci uhi; sietna bawlte a cithei beh hi loin, amate in Pasien a zelah uh ciengin a suohta uhi,” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa a zatah mite khatlekhat a kiho uhi. Topa in amate thudonin a thu uh a ngaipieh a, Topa a zatah mite le a min a lungngai mite adingin ama mai-ah phawna laibu khat kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate keima-a’ hi ding a, na ka sep ni ciengin amate keima’ neituomte ahi ding uhi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi. Nu le pate in amau’ na a sem a tate a hinkhawi bangin ken zong amate ka hinkhawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin midihte, migilote, Pasien’ na a sem mite le a sem lo mite kikalah a kilamdanna uh note in khatvei na mukia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En un, mi kiphasahte zosie le migilote zosie, lungthu sunga meikuong bangin katumin hampa gaw a suo ding hun ang tung ding hi; tua ang tung ding ni ciengin a zung a ba ci nuasie nei loin amate kihaltum sieng ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka min a zatah note adingin a hlate tungah damna a puo dihna ni ang suoh ding hi. Bawngbuh pana a kihla bawngnote bangin pusuohin na tawndien ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima in na kang sep ni ciengin note in migilote na tuoncil ding uhi, azieh pen amate ka ketaw nei-a leivui tawh a kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel zosie adingin Horeb ah ama ka thupieh, ka nasempa Moses’ thuhilnate ahi thukhamte le biehna ngaina kipte phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />En un, keima in a zauhuoi le a thupi Topa’ ni ang tun masangin note kungah kamsang Elijah kang sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in samsietna tawh gam sung a vatmai lo nadingin nu le pate’ lungtang tate tung le, tate’ lungtang nu le pate tungah ka kiheisah ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
